---
title: DocxFiller — Merge-Substitute-Writeback Algorithm
---
flowchart TD
    A([fillDocx\ndocxBytes, orderedFields, labelToValue]) --> B[XWPFDocument.open\nparse DOCX XML]

    B --> C[globalIndex = 0\nAtomicInteger shared across paragraphs]

    C --> D[DocxUtils.forEachParagraph\nbody → table cells → headers → footers]

    D --> E{globalIndex >= orderedFields.size?\nAll fields consumed?}
    E -->|Yes| SKIP([skip paragraph])
    E -->|No| F[PHASE 1: MERGE\ncollect runs\nrecord runStarts\nStringBuilder merged]

    F --> G{merged.isEmpty?}
    G -->|Yes| SKIP
    G -->|No| H[PHASE 2: SUBSTITUTE\nPlaceholderProcessor.substituteEachWithSpans\nresolver: index → labelToValue.get label\nreturns rewritten + List of SubstitutionSpan]

    H --> I{result.anyFilled?\nwere any placeholders replaced?}
    I -->|No| SKIP
    I -->|Yes| J[PHASE 3: WRITEBACK\nDocxUtils.writebackSpans\norigPos=0 rwPos=0 spanIdx=0]

    J --> K[For each run r:\norigRunEnd = runStarts r+1\nrwStart = rwPos]

    K --> L{origPos < origRunEnd?}
    L -->|Yes| M{origPos == span.originalStart?}
    M -->|Yes — placeholder boundary| N[origPos = span.originalEnd\nrwPos += span.replacementLen\nspanIdx++]
    M -->|No — passthrough char| O[origPos++\nrwPos++]
    N --> L
    O --> L

    L -->|No — run exhausted| P[run.setText\nrewritten.substring\nrwStart .. rwPos\n⚑ formatting preserved]

    P --> Q{more runs?}
    Q -->|Yes| K
    Q -->|No| R[globalIndex.addAndGet\nresult.filledCount]

    R --> S{more paragraphs?}
    S -->|Yes| D
    S -->|No| T[doc.write → ByteArrayOutputStream]

    T --> U([return filled DOCX bytes])

    style A fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style U fill:#27AE60,color:#fff
    style SKIP fill:#95A5A6,color:#fff
    style P fill:#E67E22,color:#fff
